message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Fused Hyperoperation Algebra"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24539305
authors:
  - family-names: Pope
    given-names: Brennan R.
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0001-7248-7300"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/BrennanRPope/fused-hyperoperation-algebra"
abstract: >-
  One geometric picture behind the composition law a + b + k·ab (mult-add):
  stretch a unit box by a one way and b the other, and the extra area is the
  product term. The repository gathers proofs, numerical checks, figures and
  write-ups across counting, primes, probability, relativity, gravity,
  electromagnetism and topology, with a shared machine-checked library of
  over 3,000 theorems in core Lean 4. Code is under Apache-2.0; write-ups,
  notes, pages, figures and generated data are under CC-BY-4.0.
keywords:
  - composition laws
  - formal group laws
  - Lean 4
  - formal verification
  - Clifford algebra
  - relativity
